    "id": "ex11-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex11-tab",
    "name": "Streamed circle via Move",
    "info": "No arc primitive \u2014 Function computes lat/lon ring points (\u00a7 coordinate frames). Move action Go to (altitude above home), delivery stream @ 5 Hz, TTL 1500 ms. Stop inject sends payload:false; letting injects stop also lets TTL expire. SITL bind 14550 \u2192 14551.",
